_2_4_02","missing_source_classes":["I期临床研究报告","研究者手册既往临床章节"],"target":"2.4节既往临床数据段落"},{"action":"确认KRX-451在透析人群中的PK特征（透析清除率、蛋白结合率变化）是否影响2mg bid给药方案","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_2_4_03","missing_source_classes":["特殊人群PK研究","IB药代动力学章节"],"target":"2.4节CKD-aP人群药代动力学段落"}],"heading":"本研究的理论基础","missing_source_classes":["KRX-451非临床药理学数据（体外κ/μ受体选择性验证、动物抗瘙痒模型）","KRX-451 I期临床PK/PD与安全性数据","KRX-451在终末期肾病人群中的药代动力学特征（透析清除、蛋白结合）"],"proposal_text":"KRX-451为外周选择性κ阿片受体激动剂，其设计原理在于选择性激动外周κ阿片受体以抑制外周瘙痒信号传导，同时不激动μ阿片受体，从而在理论上避免μ受体介导的呼吸抑制和药物依赖风险。慢性肾病相关瘙痒的病理生理涉及外周感觉神经末梢中κ阿片受体通路的失调，外周选择性κ激动剂通过调节该通路有望减轻瘙痒感知而不产生中枢μ受体相关不良反应。本研究为II期概念验证与剂量探索试验，旨在在维持性血液透析人群中初步验证KRX-451 2 mg每日两次口服方案的抗瘙痒疗效信号，并收集安全性数据以支持后续开发决策。研究采用多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照设计，双盲治疗期12周，安全随访期4周，以匹配安慰剂为对照，按1:1比例随机分配。","rationale":"作用机制（外周选择性κ激动、不激动μ受体、避免呼吸抑制与依赖）和研究目的（PoC、剂量探索）为项目已确认事实。设计要素（多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、12+4周、1:1）为已确认研究设计。但KRX-451非临床体外选择性验证数据、动物模型抗瘙痒证据、I期PK/PD数据及早期临床安全性信号均未在允许来源中提供，无法展开非临床证据链和既往临床数据支撑。外周选择性在终末期肾病人群中的药代动力学影响需结合IB确认。","review_advisories":["本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_ee74b6fda2c2_6aa51cae6aa85314","section_number":"2.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:3868058e9f94a50aaecb7a1b","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_466a0de7c48143873a5a:r6:fba9cc6529136766","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fb714bc3c01de1","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a1616fe22868fa","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:5425c4f8e6c0a6"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006125902_b8cce1b4","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_466a0de7c48143873a5a:revision:6","quote":"年龄段：成人；疾病状态：中重度；经治情况：经治疗效不佳；维持性血液透析患者慢性肾病相关瘙痒","quote_sha256":"edc842086a2e5d3a0574af8688e2ede3ee00a5fa75c12a68e2fa2441acb2e03a","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_466a0de7c48143873a5a:r6:fba9cc6529136766","span_id":"es4"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_466a0de7c48143873a5a:revision:6","quote":"不良事件；生命体征；实验室检查；心电图","quote_sha256":"673ff119fa4e30603d882db6822852867f8c740c8685a4dc9f6526ab4ed82480","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_466a0de7c48143873a5a:r6:fba9cc6529136766","span_id":"es5"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_466a0de7c48143873a5a:revision:6","quote":"头晕；嗜睡；口干；恶心；透析中低血压；肝酶升高；电解质紊乱","quote_sha256":"149e58756c9cb301e92910e6a09fa92e13e1fddc11946bbfd199c1482510ece3","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_466a0de7c48143873a5a:r6:fba9cc6529136766","span_id":"es8"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es4","es5","es8"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":3},"gap_items":[{"action":"确认各安全性评估项目（生命体征、实验室检查、心电图）的采集时点和频率，以及AESI的监测、判定和报告流程","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_2_5_01","missing_source_classes":["访视计划","安全性评估操作规范"],"target":"2.5节安全性评估操作细节"},{"action":"获取透析中低血压在该人群中的基线发生率、KRX-451药理关联证据及研究中的监测与干预方案","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_2_5_02","missing_source_classes":["IB安全性章节","透析中低血压管理指南"],"target":"2.5节透析中低血压管理"},{"action":"确认肝酶升高和电解质紊乱的分级标准、处理阈值和永久停药标准","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_2_5_03","missing_source_classes":["IB安全性章节","剂量调整与停药标准"],"target":"2.5节肝酶与电解质异常处理"}],"heading":"获益/风险评估","missing_source_classes":["各安全性评估项目的具体采集时点与频率","透析中低血压监测与干预方案","肝酶升高和电解质紊乱的处理阈值与停药标准","AESI因果判定与报告流程"],"proposal_text":"本研究的目标人群为18至80岁成人，疾病状态为中重度慢性肾病相关瘙痒，经治疗效不佳，且为维持性血液透析患者。该人群长期接受透析治疗，瘙痒症状严重影响生活质量和睡眠，现有常规抗组胺药和润肤剂疗效有限，存在未满足的治疗需求。KRX-451作为外周选择性κ阿片受体激动剂，其理论获益在于通过抑制外周瘙痒信号改善瘙痒症状，同时因不激动μ受体而避免呼吸抑制和依赖风险。安全性评估框架涵盖不良事件监测、生命体征测量、实验室检查和心电图检查。特别关注的不良事件包括头晕、嗜睡、口干、恶心、透析中低血压、肝酶升高和电解质紊乱，上述事件需在研究期间进行重点监测和记录。","rationale":"目标人群特征（成人、中重度、经治疗效不佳、维持性血液透析）和安全性评估类别（AE、生命体征、实验室检查、心电图）及AESI清单（头晕、嗜睡、口干、恶心、透析中低血压、肝酶升高、电解质紊乱）均为项目已确认事实。但各安全性评估项目的具体采集时点、频率、临床意义判定标准、透析中低血压的监测方案和干预措施、肝酶和电解质异常的处理阈值未在允许来源中提供。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_ee74b6fda2c2_476906c6537e7bfa","section_number":"2.5","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:3868058e9f94a50aaecb7a1b","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_466a0de7c48143873a5a:r6:fba9cc6529136766","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fb714bc3c01de1","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a1616fe22868fa","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:5425c4f8e6c0a6"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006125902_b8cce1b4","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_466a0de7c48143873a5a:revision:6","quote":"第 12 周周平均最重瘙痒 WI-NRS 较基线的变化。基线为随机前 7 天每日最重瘙痒均值；第 12 周周平均为第 12 周对应 7 天评分均值。","quote_sha256":"22f8ed036d8f6bd170a689031fe090e60caf8364717bb2dcfd06028a3db375bb","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_466a0de7c48143873a5a:r6:fba9cc6529136766","span_id":"es6"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_466a0de7c48143873a5a:revision:6","quote":"评价 WI-NRS 应答、5-D 瘙痒量表、Skindex-16及 PSQI 睡眠改善，并描述治疗期与随访期安全性","quote_sha256":"739052bef0c92d5037c847b50e728f1f64ad1d35728291bf500927062eb12636","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_466a0de7c48143873a5a:r6:fba9cc6529136766","span_id":"es7"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_466a0de7c48143873a5a:revision:6","quote":"不良事件；生命体征；实验室检查；心电图","quote_sha256":"673ff119fa4e30603d882db6822852867f8c740c8685a4dc9f6526ab4ed82480","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_466a0de7c48143873a5a:r6:fba9cc6529136766","span_id":"es5"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es6","es7","es5"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":3},"gap_items":[{"action":"确认WI-NRS、5-D瘙痒量表、Skindex-16和PSQI的具体版本、中文授权状态及研究者培训要求","category":"source_not_retrieved","gap_id":"gap_3_01","missing_source_classes":["量表授权文件","量表版本说明"],"target":"3节各量表版本与授权"}],"heading":"研究目的和终点","missing_source_classes":["量表授权文件","量表版本说明"],"proposal_text":"本研究的主要研究目的为评价KRX-451 2 mg每日两次口服较匹配安慰剂改善第12周周平均最重瘙痒WI-NRS较基线变化的疗效。主要终点为第12周周平均最重瘙痒WI-NRS较基线的变化，其中基线定义为随机前7天每日最重瘙痒评分的均值，第12周周平均定义为第12周对应7天评分的均值。次要研究目的为评价WI-NRS应答、5-D瘙痒量表、Skindex-16及PSQI睡眠改善，并描述治疗期与随访期安全性。关键次要终点为第12周WI-NRS较基线改善≥4分的应答率。其他次要终点包括第12周WI-NRS较基线改善≥4分的应答率、5-D瘙痒量表总分变化、Skindex-16总分及症状、情绪、功能维度变化、PSQI较基线变化。探索性终点为透析日与非透析日瘙痒差异。安全性终点包括不良事件、生命体征、实验室检查和心电图。","rationale":"主要研究目的、主要终点（第12周周平均最重瘙痒WI-NRS较基线变化，基线为随机前7天均值，第12周为对应7天均值）、次要研究目的（WI-NRS应答、5-D瘙痒量表、Skindex-16、PSQI）、关键次要终点（WI-NRS改善≥4分应答率）、其他次要终点（5-D总分变化、Skindex-16总分及三维度变化、PSQI变化）、探索性终点（透析日与非透析日瘙痒差异）和安全性终点（AE、生命体征、实验室检查、心电图）均为项目已确认研究事实。各量表（WI-NRS、5-D、Skindex-16、PSQI）的版本、授权和培训要求需另行确认。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（研究目的和终点）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_ee74b6fda2c2_c3765ee6f4c83454","section_number":"3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:3868058e9f94a50aaecb7a1b","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_466a0de7c48143873a5a:r6:fba9cc6529136766","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fb714bc3c01de1","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a1616fe22868fa","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:5425c4f8e6c0a6"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"abdc44399feeae2d1aa438a57025b89bcba05b43b24db4fb07a3b0eb929c3c21","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_ee74b6fda2c2_164021437bd02561:full-draft:3868058e9f94a50aaecb7a1b","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:3868058e9f94a50aaecb7a1b","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-